        <mxCell id="authors-ca-note" value="Adoption of Clean Architecture pattern" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#A9DDF3;strokeColor=#000000;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1680" y="40" width="180" height="40" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="authors-b-legend" value="Authors broken into its business capabilities. Grey lines: the Authors API delegates to each capability.&lt;br&gt;Each capability&#39;s own ports show which other subdomains it needs.&lt;br&gt;AuthorController also imports ReaderDetails and User, but never uses them: not drawn." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#A9DDF3;strokeColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;spacingLeft=6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="100" y="1310" width="690" height="110" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="authors-a-legend" value="Ball-and-socket and dashed arrows: each layer depends on the one below, as in Clean Architecture.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Thick lines&lt;/b&gt;: the layer uses another module&#39;s repositories or domain classes, not its API.&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&#39;#E06666&#39;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Soft red&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;: violation (another module&#39;s internals, an external system reached from inside the core, or a dependency pointing outwards).&lt;br&gt;Not drawn: every layer uses the Exceptions Module.&lt;br&gt;Extra dependency in the base project: Interface Adapters also use the EBR API directly.&lt;br&gt;Red dashed arrows: the domain uses a service request class; services and repositories use an api view." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#A9DDF3;strokeColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;spacingLeft=6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="830" y="1310" width="1070" height="110" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="authors-i-legend" value="Dashed grey boxes: template elements with no counterpart in the package.&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&#39;#E06666&#39;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Soft red&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;: violation. Red dashed arrows point outwards, against the dependency rule.&lt;br&gt;Not marked: BookViewMapper and the Book views (borderline: Book&#39;s REST adapter code).&lt;br&gt;AuthorService returns Book entities, so Book leaks into the controllers. Author has no lending data of its own:&lt;br&gt;the top-5 query joins the Book and Lending tables. Domain classes carry JPA annotations." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#A9DDF3;strokeColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;spacingLeft=6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
