        <mxCell id="genres-ca-note" value="Adoption of Clean Architecture pattern" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#A9DDF3;strokeColor=#000000;fontSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1680" y="40" width="180" height="40" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="genres-b-legend" value="Genres broken into its business capabilities. Grey lines: the Genres API delegates to each capability.&lt;br&gt;Genres has no endpoint to create or change genres: they only come from the data seeder.&lt;br&gt;Genre Lookup has no endpoint either: Books and Readers read genres straight from GenreRepository." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#A9DDF3;strokeColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;spacingLeft=6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="100" y="1310" width="690" height="110" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="genres-a-legend" value="Ball-and-socket and dashed arrows: each layer depends on the one below, as in Clean Architecture.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Thick lines&lt;/b&gt;: the layer uses another module&#39;s repositories or domain classes, not its API.&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&#39;#E06666&#39;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Soft red&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;: violation (another module&#39;s internals, an external system reached from inside the core, or a dependency pointing outwards).&lt;br&gt;Not drawn: every layer uses the Exceptions Module.&lt;br&gt;Genre&#39;s domain depends on nothing else.&lt;br&gt;Its statistics, though, live in queries over Book&#39;s and Lending&#39;s entities, in Frameworks &amp;amp; Drivers." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#A9DDF3;strokeColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;spacingLeft=6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="830" y="1310" width="1070" height="110" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="genres-i-legend" value="Dashed grey boxes: template elements with no counterpart in the package.&lt;br&gt;&lt;font color=&#39;#E06666&#39;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Soft red&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;: violation. Red dashed arrows point outwards, against the dependency rule.&lt;br&gt;GenreController does not use the Genre entity directly.&lt;br&gt;GenreBookCountDTO is declared in bookmanagement.services, so Genre depends on Book&#39;s application layer.&lt;br&gt;The Genre entity carries JPA annotations." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;fillColor=#A9DDF3;strokeColor=#000000;fontSize=10;align=left;spacingLeft=6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="2000" y="1310" width="1890" height="110" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
